					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3164717#post-3557199</guid>
				<title>Author&#039;s Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3164717/intro-note:charles-ogden-gears#post-3557199</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2017 01:17:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This tale series has been in the works for about two years but only in the past couple of months have I gotten around to writing it out and formalizing it. Here's hoping this is a success. I'll post the next part tomorrow or (if I'm busy all day like I think I will be) Wednesday.</p> <p>I know the GoI Format for Nobody is untenable and busted as fuck, so I tried it like this. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=966960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="anqxyr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=966960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" >anqxyr</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" >Aiden Eldritch</a></span> helped with this though it's still not perfect. For comparison, the bottom of <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/aa">this sandbox</a> is what it looks like as per the original format, but is so much harder to read the source of and actually write in. Thoughts and feedback are appreciated, and if you know how to fix the spacing issue that still persists here, please lemme know.</p> <p>Thanks to the following:</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=966960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="anqxyr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=966960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" >anqxyr</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" >Aiden Eldritch</a></span> for the format.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" >Aiden Eldritch</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1324229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="Gaffney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1324229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" >Gaffney</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anborough" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1568690&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500945526" alt="Anborough" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1568690)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anborough" >Anborough</a></span> (despite the latter not understanding what the fuck was going on) for critiquing and also liking it.</li> </ul> 
				 	]]>
